# === NPC 2: Sage of Shadows ===
~ start
Sage: You dare enter the halls of shadows? Prove your wits.
=> Q3

~ Q3
Sage: According to the half-angle identities, what is sin(x/2) equal to?
- A. sqrt(1 - cos x)/2 => Q3_WRONG
- B.sin x / (1 + cos x) => Q3_WRONG 
- C. sqrt((1 + cos x)/2) => Q3_CORRECT
- D. 1 + cos x sin x => Q3_WRONG

~ Q3_CORRECT
Sage: Clever… few wanderers achieve this.
=> END

~ Q3_WRONG
Sage: Aww… try again, mortal.
=> Q3
